.TH scw-demo 1 "" "scw" "scw Manual"
.SH NAME
scw-demo, scw demo \- Demo namespace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscw demo\fP <command>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Demo namespace
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBscw demo widget\fP
Widget management commands
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fISCW_ACCESS_KEY\fR
The access key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_SECRET_KEY\fR
The secret key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ORGANIZATION_ID\fR
The default organization ID (get your organization ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_PROJECT_ID\fR
The default project ID (get your project ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_REGION\fR
The default region
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ZONE\fR
The default availability zone
.TP
\fISCW_API_URL\fR
URL of the API
.TP
\fISCW_INSECURE\fR
Set this to true to enable the insecure mode
.TP
\fISCW_PROFILE\fR
Set the config profile to use